# This folder will contain your Unity WebGL build
# Build your game in Unity to this folder:
# File -> Build Settings -> Build -> Select "Build" folder

# After building, you should have:
# Build/
# ├── index.html
# ├── Build/
# │   ├── Build.data.gz
# │   ├── Build.framework.js.gz
# │   ├── Build.loader.js
# │   └── Build.wasm.gz
# └── TemplateData/
